WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.375
Wondering who sees what?

00:00:02.375 --> 00:00:05.606
Here's how the proposed service would work.

00:00:05.606 --> 00:00:09.922
The courier needs your contact details and pickup address.

00:00:09.922 --> 00:00:12.869
A code identifies your sample.

00:00:12.869 --> 00:00:17.061
Your report's for you, and you decide whether to discuss it with your

00:00:17.061 --> 00:00:18.336
spouse.

00:00:18.336 --> 00:00:23.347
In this demo, account and sample details stay in this browser.

00:00:23.347 --> 00:00:26.166
Please use made-up information.

00:00:26.166 --> 00:00:30.683
And you don't need an account to explore the guides.
